A
\fIgem\fP
is worth 1000 gold pieces.
Too much
\fIgold\fP
will slow a player down.
One may carry 1000 plus 200 per
\fIlevel\fP
of
\fIgold .\fP
A
\fIgem\fP
weighs one half a gold piece.
Monsters of treasure type 7 or higher may carry
\fIgems .\fP
.PP
